		'EUROPEAN PORTUGUESE MANDATORY CONTRACTIONS CAN NEVER BE LEFT UNCONTRACTED, AND INLINE HTML TAGS DO NOT LICENSE BREAKING THEM. Translate the sentence whole, then place the tags: em+a/as/o/os = na/nas/no/nos, de+a/o = da/do, a+a = à, por+o = pelo, em+um = num. Write «Apoiando-nos <a href=\'/history\'>nas nossas muitas marcas,</a>», never «Apoiando-nos em <a>as nossas muitas marcas,</a>»; if the contraction would straddle an anchor boundary, move the article inside the anchor. «em as», «de a», «a a» are impossible in Portuguese and are the single most recognisable machine-translation tell.',
